  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Cooperative Administrative Support Services (ICASS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Cooperative Administrative Support Services (ICASS) program is a program through which the U.S. Government provides and shares the cost of common administrative support at posts overseas. USAID is a participant agency in ICASS. This chapter provides policy and procedures for USAID&apos;s participation in ICASS at posts abroad.</narrative>
  </description>
